{
  "record_type": "wuyingdian_column_transcription_and_collation",
  "title": "武英殿本梁書卷二十一王志傳",
  "catalog_revision": 902340163,
  "catalog_permalink": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=902340163",
  "pdf_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/NLC892-411999017142-12657_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC166%E5%86%8A.pdf",
  "pdf_sha1": "b11514da8e27fc149ba1ddc8e42a71bd01cd4e25",
  "holding": "中國國家圖書館，NLC892-411999017142-12657，二十四史第166冊。卷首刻乾隆四年校刊。",
  "column_file": "source-evidence/liang021-wangzhi/wyd-columns.txt",
  "column_file_sha256": "6cb11d29f5f1b17fccce41c7ab1b3a1a9407ce97bd0b109ce070c05ba50e8550",
  "columns": [
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "reading": "王志字次道琅邪臨沂人祖曇首宋左光祿大夫豫寧"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 42,
      "reading": "文侯父僧虔齊司空簡穆公並有重名志年九歲居所"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "start_codepoint": 42,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "reading": "生母憂哀容毀瘠為中表所異弱冠選尚宋孝武女安"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 84,
      "reading": "固公主拜駙馬都尉秘書郎累遷太尉行參軍太子舍"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 105,
      "reading": "人武陵王文學褚淵為司徒引志為主簿淵謂僧虔曰"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "start_codepoint": 105,
      "end_codepoint": 126,
      "reading": "朝廷之恩本為殊特所可光榮在屈賢子累遷鎮北竟"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "start_codepoint": 126,
      "end_codepoint": 147,
      "reading": "陵王功曹史安陸南郡二王友入為中書侍郎尋除宣"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "start_codepoint": 147,
      "end_codepoint": 168,
      "reading": "城內史清謹有恩惠郡民張倪吳慶爭田經年不決志"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "start_codepoint": 168,
      "end_codepoint": 189,
      "reading": "到官父老乃相謂曰王府君有德政吾曹鄉里乃有此"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "start_codepoint": 189,
      "end_codepoint": 210,
      "reading": "爭倪慶相攜請罪所訟地遂為閑田徵拜黃門侍郎尋"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "start_codepoint": 210,
      "end_codepoint": 231,
      "reading": "遷吏部侍郎出為寧朔將軍東陽太守郡獄有重囚十"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "start_codepoint": 231,
      "end_codepoint": 252,
      "reading": "餘人冬至日悉遣還家過節皆返惟一人失期獄司以"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "二下",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "start_codepoint": 252,
      "end_codepoint": 273,
      "reading": "為言志曰此自太守事主者勿憂明旦果自詣獄辭以"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "start_codepoint": 273,
      "end_codepoint": 294,
      "reading": "婦孕吏民益歎服之視事三年齊永明二年入為侍中"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "start_codepoint": 294,
      "end_codepoint": 315,
      "reading": "未拜轉吏部尚書在選以和理稱崔慧景平以例加右"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "start_codepoint": 315,
      "end_codepoint": 336,
      "reading": "軍將軍封臨汝侯固讓不受改領右衛將軍義師至城"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "start_codepoint": 336,
      "end_codepoint": 357,
      "reading": "內害東昏百僚署名送其首志聞而歎曰冠雖弊可加"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "start_codepoint": 357,
      "end_codepoint": 378,
      "reading": "足乎因取庭中樹葉按服之偽悶不署名高祖覽牋無"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "start_codepoint": 378,
      "end_codepoint": 399,
      "reading": "志署心嘉之弗以讓也霸府開以志為右軍將軍驃騎"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "start_codepoint": 399,
      "end_codepoint": 420,
      "reading": "大將軍長史梁臺建遷散騎常侍中書令天監元年以"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "start_codepoint": 420,
      "end_codepoint": 441,
      "reading": "本官領前軍將軍其年遷冠軍將軍丹陽尹為政清靜"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "start_codepoint": 441,
      "end_codepoint": 462,
      "reading": "去煩苛京師有寡婦無子姑亡舉債以斂葬既葬而無"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 4,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "三上",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "start_codepoint": 462,
      "end_codepoint": 483,
      "reading": "以還之志愍其義以俸錢償焉時年饑每旦為粥於郡"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "start_codepoint": 483,
      "end_codepoint": 504,
      "reading": "門以賦百姓民稱之不容口三年為散騎常侍中書令"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "start_codepoint": 504,
      "end_codepoint": 525,
      "reading": "領游擊將軍志為中書令及居京尹便懷止足常謂諸"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "start_codepoint": 525,
      "end_codepoint": 546,
      "reading": "子姪曰謝莊在宋孝武世位止中書令吾自視豈可以"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "start_codepoint": 546,
      "end_codepoint": 567,
      "reading": "過之因多謝病簡通賓客遷前將軍太常卿六年出為"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "start_codepoint": 567,
      "end_codepoint": 588,
      "reading": "雲麾將軍安西始興王長史南郡太守明年遷軍師將"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "start_codepoint": 588,
      "end_codepoint": 609,
      "reading": "軍平西鄱陽郡王長史江夏太守並加秩中二千石九"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "start_codepoint": 609,
      "end_codepoint": 630,
      "reading": "年遷為散騎常侍金紫光祿大夫十二年卒時年五十"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "start_codepoint": 630,
      "end_codepoint": 651,
      "reading": "四志善草隸當時以為楷法齊游擊將軍徐希秀亦號"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "start_codepoint": 651,
      "end_codepoint": 672,
      "reading": "能書常謂志為書聖志家世居建康禁中里馬蕃巷父"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "三下",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "start_codepoint": 672,
      "end_codepoint": 693,
      "reading": "僧虔以來門風多寬恕志尤惇厚所歷職不以罪咎劾"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "四上",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "start_codepoint": 693,
      "end_codepoint": 714,
      "reading": "人門下客嘗盜脫志車𨏥賣之志知而不問待之如初"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "四上",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "start_codepoint": 714,
      "end_codepoint": 735,
      "reading": "賓客游其門者專覆其過而稱其善兄弟子姪皆篤實"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "四上",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "start_codepoint": 735,
      "end_codepoint": 756,
      "reading": "謙和時人號馬蕃諸王為長者普通四年志改葬高祖"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 5,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "四上",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "start_codepoint": 756,
      "end_codepoint": 775,
      "reading": "厚賻賜之追諡曰安有五子緝休諲操素並知名"
    }
  ],
